system: shader-runner
unit: cross-spec-refs
kind: workflow
source:
  repo: bevy_shader_runner
  paths:
    - src/watch/dispatcher.rs

## modules
Dispatcher   — routes each changed asset to the right reload path @ src/watch/dispatcher.rs @ spec terrain-erosion/mesh-terrain-chunks
ResultWriter — records reload outcomes @ spec write-reload-results

## data
struct ChangedAsset {
  path: String,
  batch_id: Uuid,
}

in:  Queue<ChangedAsset>
out: Stream<String>

## behavior
- pull a changed asset from the queue
- for each asset: @ spec terrain-erosion/mesh-terrain-chunks
  - enqueue a reload task
- if the reload fails:
  - hand the asset to the batch retry flow @ spec reload-shader-batch

## invariants
- every failed reload reaches the batch flow @ spec shader-runner/reload-shader-batch
